    {id:"m2-geo-v2-final-02",grade:"middle2",unit:"geometry-properties",conceptId:"polygon-interior-sum",level:"concept",type:"multiple-choice",question:"칠각형(변이 7개인 다각형)의 내각의 합은 얼마일까요?",choices:["720°","900°","1080°","540°"],correctAnswer:"900°",explanation:"다각형의 내각의 합은 180°×(n-2)이므로 180°×(7-2)=900°입니다.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"칠각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M150,25 L224.3,60.8 L242.6,141.1 L191.2,205.6 L108.8,205.6 L57.4,141.1 L75.7,60.8 Z\"/></svg>"},
    {id:"m2-geo-v2-final-03",grade:"middle2",unit:"geometry-properties",conceptId:"polygon-exterior-sum",level:"basic",type:"multiple-choice",question:"정육각형의 한 외각의 크기는 얼마일까요?",choices:["45°","60°","72°","90°"],correctAnswer:"60°",explanation:"다각형의 외각의 합은 항상 360°이고, 정육각형은 외각 6개가 모두 같으므로 360°÷6=60°입니다.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"정육각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M150,25 L232.3,72.5 L232.3,167.5 L150,215 L67.7,167.5 L67.7,72.5 Z\"/></svg>"},
    {id:"m2-geo-v2-final-04",grade:"middle2",unit:"geometry-properties",conceptId:"parallel-lines-properties",level:"basic",type:"multiple-choice",question:"두 직선이 서로 평행합니다. 한 각이 130°일 때, 그 각의 엇각의 크기는 얼마일까요?",choices:["50°","130°","180°","65°"],correctAnswer:"130°",explanation:"평행선에서 엇각의 크기는 서로 같으므로 130°입니다.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"평행선과 엇각, 130도\"><line class=\"d-line\" x1=\"20\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"60\"/><line class=\"d-line\" x1=\"20\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"170\"/><line class=\"d-line\" x1=\"206.1\" y1=\"40.8\" x2=\"81.6\" y2=\"189.2\"/><path class=\"d-line\" d=\"M265,54 L275,60 L265,66\"/><path class=\"d-line\" d=\"M265,164 L275,170 L265,176\"/><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M216,60 L215.7,63.7 L215,67.3 L213.7,70.7 L211.9,74 L209.7,76.9 L207.1,79.5 L204.2,81.8 L201,83.6 L197.5,84.9 L194,85.7 L190.3,86 L186.6,85.8 L183,85 L179.5,83.8 L176.3,82.1 L173.3,79.9\"/><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M71.7,170 L72,166.3 L72.7,162.7 L74,159.3 L75.8,156 L78,153.1 L80.6,150.5 L83.5,148.2 L86.7,146.4 L90.2,145.1 L93.7,144.3 L97.4,144 L101.1,144.2 L104.7,145 L108.2,146.2 L111.4,147.9 L114.4,150.1\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"208.6\" y=\"99.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">130°</text><text class=\"d-highlight\" x=\"79.1\" y=\"130.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text></svg>"},
    {id:"m2-geo-v2-final-05",grade:"middle2",unit:"geometry-properties",conceptId:"polygon-interior-sum",level:"application",type:"multiple-choice",question:"오각형 모양의 표지판이 있습니다. 다섯 내각 중 네 각이 각각 100°, 100°, 110°, 110°일 때, 나머지 한 각의 크기는 얼마일까요? (오각형의 내각의 합은 540°입니다.)",choices:["100°","110°","120°","130°"],correctAnswer:"120°",explanation:"540° - (100°+100°+110°+110°) = 120°이므로 나머지 한 각은 120°입니다.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 216.2 208.5\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"오각형의 다섯 내각\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M58.8,30 L158.8,30 L176.2,128.5 L89.6,178.5 L40,136.9 Z\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"75.6\" y=\"49.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">100°</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"142.1\" y=\"49.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">100°</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"152.6\" y=\"117.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">110°</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"91.9\" y=\"152.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">110°</text><text class=\"d-highlight\" x=\"64.4\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text></svg>"},
    {id:"m2-geo-ext1-final-13",grade:"middle2",unit:"geometry-properties",conceptId:"parallel-lines-properties",type:"multiple-choice",question:"두 평행선 사이에 꺾인 선이 있어요. 위쪽 각이 55°, 아래쪽 각이 48°일 때, 꺾이는 점의 각 x는 얼마일까요?",choices:["103°","7°","97°","93°"],correctAnswer:"103°",explanation:"평행선 성질로 두 각을 꺾이는 점으로 옮기면 x=55°+48°=103°입니다.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"평행선 사이의 꺾인 선\"><line class=\"d-line\" x1=\"20\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"60\"/><line class=\"d-line\" x1=\"20\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"170\"/><line class=\"d-line\" x1=\"95\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"118\"/><line class=\"d-line\" x1=\"150\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"205\" y2=\"170\"/><path class=\"d-line\" d=\"M255,60 L265,60 L265,50\"/><path class=\"d-line\" d=\"M255,170 L265,170 L265,160\"/><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M123,60 A28,28 0 0,1 114.3,80.3\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"135.4\" y=\"77.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">55°</text><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M233,170 A28,28 0 0,0 184.7,150.8\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"221.3\" y=\"129.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">48°</text><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M132.1,99.1 A26,26 0 0,1 168.9,135.9\"/><text class=\"d-highlight\" x=\"179.7\" y=\"88.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text></svg>"},
    {id:"m2-geo-ext1-final-14",grade:"middle2",unit:"geometry-properties",conceptId:"polygon-interior-sum",type:"multiple-choice",question:"내각의 합이 1800°인 다각형이 있어요. 이 다각형의 모든 내각의 크기가 같다면, 한 내각의 크기는 얼마일까요? (먼저 몇 각형인지 구한 뒤, 한 내각을 구하세요)",choices:["150°","144°","156°","160°"],correctAnswer:"150°",explanation:"1800°÷180°=10, n-2=10이므로 n=12(십이각형). 한 내각=1800°÷12=150°입니다.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"20 10 260 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"정십이각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M150,23 L197.5,35.7 L232.3,70.5 L245,118 L232.3,165.5 L197.5,200.3 L150,213 L102.5,200.3 L67.7,165.5 L55,118 L67.7,70.5 L102.5,35.7 Z\"/></svg>"},
    {id:"m2-geo-ext1-final-15",grade:"middle2",unit:"geometry-properties",conceptId:"polygon-exterior-sum",type:"multiple-choice",question:"정다각형의 한 외각이, 정삼각형의 한 내각(60°)의 절반이에요. 이 다각형은 몇 각형인가요? (먼저 외각의 크기를 구한 뒤, 몇 각형인지 구하세요)",choices:["10각형","12각형","15각형","9각형"],correctAnswer:"12각형",explanation:"외각=60°÷2=30°이고, 360°÷30°=12이므로 정십이각형입니다.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"20 10 260 220\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"12각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M150,23 L197.5,35.7 L232.3,70.5 L245,118 L232.3,165.5 L197.5,200.3 L150,213 L102.5,200.3 L67.7,165.5 L55,118 L67.7,70.5 L102.5,35.7 Z\"/><line class=\"d-line d-dash\" x1=\"150\" y1=\"23\" x2=\"203.1\" y2=\"8.8\"/><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M175.1,16.3 A26,26 0 0,1 175.1,29.7\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"192\" y=\"23\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">30°</text></svg>"},
    {id:"m2-geo-ext1-final-16",grade:"middle2",unit:"geometry-properties",conceptId:"triangle-exterior-angle",type:"multiple-choice",question:"삼각형 ALR에서 ∠L = 33°이고, ∠R의 외각이 121°일 때, ∠A의 크기를 구하세요. (먼저 ∠R을 구한 뒤, 삼각형 내각의 합을 이용하세요)",choices:["88°","59°","121°","92°"],correctAnswer:"88°",explanation:"∠R=180°-121°=59°이고, ∠A=180°-33°-59°=88°입니다.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-69.1 -151.6 363.1 204.5\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"삼각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M0,0 L180,0 L129.5,-84.1 Z\"/><line class=\"d-line d-dash\" x1=\"180\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"0\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"-25.1\" y=\"6.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">L</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"204.4\" y=\"8.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">R</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"140.5\" y=\"-107.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M30,0 A30,30 0 0,0 25.2,-16.3\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"44.1\" y=\"-13.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">33°</text><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M104.3,-67.7 A30,30 0 0,0 144.9,-58.4\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"119.1\" y=\"-39.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x</text><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M210,0 A30,30 0 0,0 164.5,-25.7\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"202.7\" y=\"-40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">121°</text></svg>"}
